From: GA36 FW <ga36@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 0003] ga36: add MIPI DSI and DPHY base address defines

Add SUNXI_DSI_BASE and SUNXI_DPHY_BASE defines for the Allwinner A33
MIPI DSI controller and D-PHY.

CRITICAL: The DSI controller on A33 is at 0x01CA0000 and the D-PHY at
0x01CA1000, NOT at 0x01c24000/0x01c24400 as some references claim.
This is confirmed by the Linux kernel sun8i-a33.dtsi and the A33 user
manual memory map.

---

 arch/arm/include/asm/arch-sunxi/cpu_sun4i.h | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-sunxi/cpu_sun4i.h b/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-sunxi/cpu_sun4i.h
index xxxxxxx..yyyyyyy 100644
--- a/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-sunxi/cpu_sun4i.h
+++ b/arch/arm/include/asm/arch-sunxi/cpu_sun4i.h
@@ -45,6 +45,10 @@
 #define SUNXI_SJTAG_BASE		0x01c23c00
 
 #define SUNXI_TP_BASE			0x01c25000
+
+#define SUNXI_DSI_BASE			0x01ca0000
+#define SUNXI_DPHY_BASE			0x01ca1000
+
 #define SUNXI_PMU_BASE			0x01c25400
 
 #if defined CONFIG_MACH_SUN7I || defined CONFIG_MACH_SUN8I_R40
